{"id":"a8c17e59e6ab2d52","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-josephus.md","title":"FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem","display":"FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-josephus","aliases":["93-thm-josephus"],"display":"FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-fep]]","[[93-df-wep]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-josephus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-josephus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98ea8403ba8386af\" href=\"?note=98ea8403ba8386af\" title=\"93-df-fep\">93-df-fep</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d523f19a7e4590f1\" href=\"?note=d523f19a7e4590f1\" title=\"93-df-wep\">93-df-wep</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-josephus-—-FEP-to-WEP-Compactness-Theorem\">thm-josephus — FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"98ea8403ba8386af\" href=\"?note=98ea8403ba8386af\" title=\"93-df-fep\">93-df-fep</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d523f19a7e4590f1\" href=\"?note=d523f19a7e4590f1\" title=\"93-df-wep\">93-df-wep</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}josephus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}josephus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>With <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d523f19a7e4590f1\" href=\"?note=d523f19a7e4590f1\" title=\"93-df-wep\">93-df-wep</a> understood as embeddability into an ultraproduct of finite members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>, the implication follows by realizing every finite part of the atomic diagram and applying compactness.  The legacy label is retained, but this statement is not Jónsson's lemma.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-josephus-—-FEP-to-WEP-Compactness-Theorem","text":"thm-josephus — FEP-to-WEP Compactness Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-fep","status":"resolved","id":"98ea8403ba8386af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-fep]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-wep","status":"resolved","id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-wep]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subalgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-fep","status":"resolved","id":"98ea8403ba8386af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-fep]] and [[93-df-wep]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-wep","status":"resolved","id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-fep]] and [[93-df-wep]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-wep","status":"resolved","id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"With [[93-df-wep]] understood as embeddability into an ultraproduct of finite members of $\\mathcal V$, the implication follows by realizing every finite part of the atomic diagram and applying compactness.  The legacy label is retained, but this statement is not Jónsson's lemma.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}josephus}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":1012,"backlinks":[{"id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"“WEP” here is the Whole Embedding Property used by [[93-thm-josephus]]: every whole member embeds into an ultraproduct of finite members of the same class."}],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d","98ea8403ba8386af","d523f19a7e4590f1","154cc3ca1a9b40e2"]}